01:04:02.820 --> 01:04:08.750
<v Ira Glass>And should we even do this? Yeah, we have to do this. We can't stop doing this. OK.

01:04:08.750 --> 01:04:12.250
<v Ira Glass>Torey, of course, is moving on to other things. Though what does he got planned for this weekend?

01:04:12.250 --> 01:04:16.470
<v Antwaun Wells>I'm gonna go commit a crime, make me some money, and then go get me a dope sack.

